# Everything the build writes
# (in any directory: a run started from the wrong directory makes one there)
out/
# your own disc images and installers, which make retail, make sdk and make
# demo install from (docs/BUILDING.md; hard links are good)
/isos/
# the ext/rez/ submodule's directory, which older checkouts have: no longer
# a submodule (its data stays where it is)
/ext/rez/
# build/build.mk's Wine prefix, generated rules and header dependencies
/.wine/
/.build/
# Monolith's project files put every output in a built/ directory
src/**/[Bb]uilt/
# the LithTech Jupiter SDK's source, copied from its install at build time
# by ext/tools/jupitersrc.py (docs/LICENSE_NOTES.md: not to be committed)
src/Game/Libs/WONAPI/
# the retail Lithtech.exe's icon, copied from assets/art/lithtech/ at build
# time by build/all.sh (build/retailextract.py art install)
src/Engine/runtime/winbuild/lithtech/res/lithtech.ico
# generated by flex/bison at build time (src/Game/ObjectDLL/ObjectShared/)
src/Game/ObjectDLL/ObjectShared/AnimationLex.o
src/Game/ObjectDLL/ObjectShared/AnimationParse.o
src/Game/ObjectDLL/ObjectShared/AnimationLexSymbols.h

__pycache__/
*.log
!src/**/*.log
